# Trial by Earth (battlefield.trial_by_earth): the requirement arms. Main, a level 75 Summoner with the quest accepted
# but no Tuning Fork of Earth: EP_Entrance: the key item check fails (and no other fight of the zone is on offer): no
# options, and the zone has no NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY text: EP_Entrance's default PROTOCRYSTAL. bob, a level 75 Summoner
# with the fork but the quest only available: BattlefieldQuest's check (accepted or more) fails: PROTOCRYSTAL.
lists CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrigger
char zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.455,-493.9 job=SMN lvl=75
char bob zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.455,-493.9 job=SMN lvl=75
quest Bastok.TrialByEarth accepted
bob: keyitem TuningForkOfEarth
login
trigger EP_Entrance                     # accepted, no fork: no options: the default PROTOCRYSTAL
bob: login
bob: trigger EP_Entrance                # the fork, available: no options: PROTOCRYSTAL
